                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Also fetch OpenStreetMap roads and paved surfaces (highway centrelines buffered by their width or lane count, area:highway, car parks, paved plazas) as two more Land Cover layers, 'roads' and 'paved', that City Surface carries as their own triangle groups following the terrain.</item>
